'''Bombgaggers''' are monsters added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Repentance]]'' DLC and are exclusively found in {{s|Ashpit}}.

When near Isaac, they will begin to vomit up a {{E|Giga Bomb}} and proceed to run to a safe distance.

== Notes ==
* {{t|Safety Scissors}} can be used to defuse and pick up the Giga Bombs that Bombgaggers produce.

== Trivia ==
* Referred to as Toothman by the development team before Repentance's release.

